[](images/f7/f7a5126928d43be82d3e4a167b52b34d8ed4ec33e94b991ecb8486caf3e3d4a9.png)\n\nTherefore, the intersection of the intervals is ${\\color{blue}[-1,2]}.$ Symbolically, we write\n\n$$\n{\\color{red}(-\\infty,2]} \\cap {\\color{red}[-1,\\infty)} = {\\color{blue}[-1,2]}.\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065436 #edb/ref 1065 8683 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065436 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "db563ec9-015b-505d-a764-ade8484216bb" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186065436 #edb/ref 1067 "Introduction" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186068826 #edb/ref 1037 #edb/ref 17592186049861 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186068826 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186069057 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186068826 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186069259 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186068826 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186233457 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186068826 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186501215 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186068826 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186501222 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186068826 #edb/ref 1039 "Simplifying a Radical Expression That Is Not a Perfect Square With Larger Powers" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186068826 #edb/ref 1041 #edb/ref 17592186068676 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186068826 #edb/ref 1042 #uuid "f2471751-7e5c-5823-9f63-76d14f927db2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186068828 #edb/ref 1037 #edb/ref 17592186049843 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186068828 #edb/ref 1037 #edb/ref 17592186049923 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186068828 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186069056 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186068828 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186069206 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186068828 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186501139 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186068828 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186501216 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186068828 #edb/ref 1039 "Simplifying a Radical Expression That Is Not a Perfect Square" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186068828 #edb/ref 1041 #edb/ref 17592186068432 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17